OL,3,GNEWSAYour pictures: Autumn colours and
OL,4,Arising mists
OL,5,
OL,6,FAutumn has well and truly arrived in
OL,7,Fnorth-east England and Cumbria,
OL,8,Fbringing with it a blaze of colour -
OL,9,Fand chillier temperatures.
OL,11,FBut that has not put off our BBC
OL,12,FWeather Watchers, who have been out and
OL,13,Fabout capturing the scenes at all times
OL,14,Fof the day.
OL,16,FHere are some of our favourite snaps.
OL,18,FFind out how to join in with Weather
OL,19,FWatchers here. Or send your photos to
OL,20,FLook North.
